+
+/// The REAL desktop sign-in hops behind [FaUiSso] (issue #1321): thin
+/// wrappers over the CLI's loopback-callback flows — the exact functions
+/// the CLI runs (`runCodeMieSsoCliFlow`, `runChatGptOAuthCliFlow`,
