/// Secure-store name of a ChatGPT entry's OAuth credentials blob:
/// `FA_KEY_CHATGPT_COM_<SANITIZED_ENTRY_NAME>`. Byte-identical with the
/// CLI's `CustomProviderRegistry.keyNameFor(chatGptCodexBaseUrl,
