**`connectCodeMie`'s re-auth branch: `registry.rememberKey(existing.id, credentials.authToken)` — no `update()` to bump anything — fine (key only).

Another potential issue — **`_landEntry` id collision:** `registry.add` uses `'p${DateTime.now().microsecondsSinceEpoch}'` — pre-existing registry concern, not this PR.

