The test NAME says "and is logged" but there's NO assertion on the debugPrint log! The log is kDebugMode-gated debugPrint — testable via `debugPrint = (String? msg, {int? wrapWidth}) {}` capture. The test only asserts hide/unhide. Test name promises log coverage that isn't asserted. Minor test-quality gap (SUGGESTION): capture debugPrint output and assert the message names 'openai (OpenAI)'. AC3's "log line" half is untested.

